8-alpha-negative CD11b-positive dendritic cell\")\n13100:# Class: obo:CL_0001004 (immature CD8-alpha-positive CD11b-negative dendritic cell)\n13102:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:amm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GO_REF:0000031\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMCID:PMC2346585\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0001004 \"Immature CD8-alpha-positive CD11b-negative dendritic cell is a CD8-alpha-positive CD11b-negative dendritic cell that is CD80-low, CD86-low, and MHCII-low.\")\n13104:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0001004 \"immature CD8-alpha-positive CD11b-negative dendritic cell\")\n13109:# Class: obo:CL_0001005 (mature CD8-alpha-positive CD11b-negative dendritic cell)\n13111:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:amm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GO_REF:0000031\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMCID:PMC2346585\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0001005 \"Mature CD8-alpha-positive CD11b-negative dendritic cell is a CD8-alpha-positive CD11b-negative dendritic cell that is CD80-high, CD86-high, MHCII-high and is CD83-positive.\")\n13113:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0001005 \"mature CD8-alpha-positive CD11b-negative dendritic cell\")\n13120:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:amm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GO_REF:0000031\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMCID:PMC2346585\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0001006 \"Dermal dendritic cell is a conventional dendritic cell that is CD11b-positive, CD205-positive and CD8 alpha-negative.\")\n13137:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:amm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GO_REF:0000031\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:17952047\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19022770\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0001008 \"A hematopoietic stem cell that has plasma membrane part Kit-positive, SCA-1-positive, CD150-positive and CD34-negative.\")\n13173:# Class: obo:CL_0001012 (CD7-negative lymphoid progenitor OR granulocyte monocyte progenitor)\n13176:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0001012 \"CD7-negative lymphoid progenitor OR granulocyte monocyte progenitor\")\n13272:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:amm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GO_REF:0000031\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:1261582\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:17952047\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"http://www.immgen.org/index_content.html\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0001023 \"A common myeloid progenitor that is Kit-positive and CD34-positive, Il7ra-negative, and is SCA1-low and Fcgr2-low and Fcgr3-low.\")\n13281:# Class: obo:CL_0001024 (CD34-positive, CD38-negative hematopoietic stem cell)\n13287:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0001024 \"CD34-positive, CD38-negative hematopoietic stem cell\")\n13305:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:amm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GO_REF:0000031\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMCID:PMC2626675\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:16551251\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0001026 \"A common myeloid progenitor that is CD34-positive, CD38-positive, IL3ra-low, CD10-negative, CD7-negative, CD45RA-negative, and IL-5Ralpha-negative.\")\n13313:# Class: obo:CL_0001027 (CD7-negative lymphoid progenitor cell)\n13315:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:amm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GO_REF:0000031\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:16551251\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0001027 \"CD7-negative lymphoid progenitor cell is a lymphoid progenitor cell that is CD34-positive, CD7-negative and CD45RA-negative.\")\n13316:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0001027 \"CD7-negative lymphoid precursor\")\n13318:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0001027 \"CD7-negative lymphoid progenitor cell\")\n13325:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:amm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GO_REF:0000031\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:16551251\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19491395\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0001028 \"CD7-positive lymphoid progenitor cell is a lymphoid progenitor cell that is CD34-positive, CD7-positive and is CD45RA-negative.\")\n13339:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0001029 \"Surface markers are for mouse cells. Originally described in the dendritic cell ontology (DC_CL:0000041) CDP are reportedly CD2-negative, CD3-negative, CD4-negative, CD5-negative, CD8a-negative, CD11c-positive, CD14-negative, CD19-negative, CD20-negative, CD56-negative, B220-negative, Ly6g-negative, MHCII-positive, and Ter119-negative. (PMID:19243617).\")\n13424:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0001041 \"These cells may be the human equivalent of murine CD8-positive, CD122-positive alpha-beta regulatory T cell. They are also found in the CD45RA-negative and CD62L-positive fraction.\")\n13439:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0001042 \"TH22 cells are also reportedly CCR4-positive, CCR6-positive, CCR10-positive, CXCR3-negative. TH22 cells are reportedly capable of secreting IL-13.\")\n13447:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:22343568\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0001043 \"A recently activated CD4-positive, alpha-beta T cell with the phenotype HLA-DRA-positive, CD38-positive, CD69-positive, CD62L-negative, CD127-negative, and CD25-positive.\")\n13459:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:22343568\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0001044 \"A CD4-positive, alpha-beta T cell with the phenotype CCR7-negative, CD45RA-positive.\")\n13471:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbX