ive, CD41-positive, and CD42-negative.\")\n14202:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0002025 \"CD34-positive, CD41-positive, CD42-negative megakaryocyte progenitor cell\")\n14207:# Class: obo:CL_0002026 (CD34-negative, CD41-positive, CD42-positive megakaryocyte cell)\n14209:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:ak\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:15232614\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002026 \"A megakaryocyte progenitor cell that is CD34-negative, CD41-positive and CD42-positive.\")\n14213:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0002026 \"CD34-negative, CD41-positive, CD42-positive megakaryocyte cell\")\n14231:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:ak\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:dsd\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMCID:PMC1312421\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002028 \"A cell type that can give rise to basophil and mast cells. This cell is CD34-positive, CD117-positive, CD125-positive, FceRIa-negative, and T1/ST2-negative, and expresses Gata-1, Gata-2, C/EBPa\")\n14243:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMCID:PMC1312421\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002029 \"A lineage-negative, Kit-positive, CD45-positive mast cell progenitor that is Fc-epsilon RIalpha-low.\")\n14253:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMCID:PMC1312421\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002030 \"A lineage negative, Sca1-negative basophil progenitor cell that is Fc epsilon RIalpha-high.\")\n14279:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0002032 \"This cell type is intended to be compatible with any vertebrate hematopoietic oligopotent progenitor cell.  For mammalian hematopoietic oligopotent progenitor cells known to be lineage-negative, please use the term 'hematopoietic oligopotent progenitor cell' (CL_0001060).\")\n14288:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:15572596\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19022770\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002033 \"A hematopoietic stem cell capable of rapid replenishment of myeloerythroid progenitors and limited self renewal capability. This cell is Kit-positive, Sca1-positive, CD34-positive, CD150-positive, and is Flt3-negative.\")\n14301:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:15572596\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:17582345\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002034 \"A hematopoietic stem cell with long term self renewal capability. This cell is Kit-positive, Sca1-positive, CD150-positive, CD90-low, CD34-negative and Flt3-negative.\")\n14311:# Class: obo:CL_0002035 (Slamf1-negative multipotent progenitor cell)\n14313:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19022770\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002035 \"A hematopoietic progenitor that has restricted self-renewal capability. Cell is Kit-positive, Ly6-positive, CD150-negative and Flt3-negative.\")\n14317:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0002035 \"Slamf1-negative multipotent progenitor cell\")\n14324:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19022770\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002036 \"A hematopoietic progenitor that has some limited self-renewal capability. Cells are lin-negative, Kit-positive, CD34-positive, and Slamf1-positive.\")\n14347:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19855402\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20107805\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:22043829\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002038 \"A CD4-positive, CXCR5-positive, CCR7-negative alpha-beta T cell located in follicles of secondary lymph nodes that is BCL6-high, ICOS-high and PD1-high, and stimulates follicular B cells to undergo class-switching and antibody production.\")\n14365:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:16087715\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:17589542\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19423665\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:26802287\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:38440725\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002039 \"A CD24-high, CD4-low, CD8-low, CD44-negative, NK1.1-negative NK T cell.\")\n14376:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:16087715\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:17589542\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19423665\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:26802287\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:38440725\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"http://www.immgen.org/index_content.html\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002040 \"A CD24-low, CD44-negative, NK1.1-negative NK T cell.\")\n14388:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:16087715\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:17589542\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19423665\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:26802287\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:38440725\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002041 \"A CD24-low, CD44-positive, DX5-low, NK1.1-negative NK T cell.\")\n14400:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:16087715\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:17589542\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19423665\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:26802287\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:38440725\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"http://www.immgen.org/index_content.html\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002042 \"A CD24-low, CD44-positive, DX5-high, NK1.1-negative NK T cell.\")\n14410:# Class: obo:CL_0002043 (CD34-positive, CD38-negative multipotent progenitor cell)\n14412:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:18371405\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19022770\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002043 \"A hematopoietic multipotent progenitor cell that is CD34-positive, CD38-negative, CD45RA-negative, and CD90-negative.\")\n14416:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0002043 \"CD34-positive, CD38-negative multipotent progenitor cell\")\n14423:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:ak\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002044 \"A basophil mast progenitor cell that is Beta-7 integrin-high, Kit-positive FcRgammaII/III-positive and Sca1-negative.\")\n14433:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:ak\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:12633665\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:17582343\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37442242\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"http://www.immgen.org/index_content.html\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002045 \"A pro-B cell that is CD45R/B220-positive, CD43-positive, HSA-low, BP-1-negative and Ly6c-negative. This cell type is also described as being lin-negative, AA4-positive, Kit-positive, IL7Ra-positive and CD45R-positive.\")\n14445:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:dsd\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:18432934\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002046 \"A pro-B cell that is CD22-positive, CD34-positive, CD38-positive and TdT-positive (has TdT activity). Pre-BCR is expressed on the cell surface. Cell is CD19-negative, CD20-negative, complement receptor type 2-negative and CD10-low. D-to-J recombination of the heavy chain occurs at this stage.\")\n14448:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0002046 \"Markers are commonly associated with human cells. These cells are also reportedly CD21-negative. Transcription factors: PU.1-positive, Ikaros-positive, E2A-positive, and PAX5-positive.\")\n14455:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:ak\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:18432934\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37442242\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002047 \"A precursor B cell that is CD45RA-positive, CD43-positive, CD24-positive and BP-1-negative.\")\n14471:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0002048 \"Late pro-B cells are also reportedly CD10-positive, CD20-negative, CD21-negative, and TdT-positive. Transcription factors: PU.1-positive, Ikaros-positive, E2A-positive, and PAX5-positive.\")\n14514:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:ak\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:dsd\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:17582343\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:18432934\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37442242\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"http://www.immgen.org/index_content.html\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002052 \"A pre-B cell that is pre-BCR-negative, and the kappa- and lambda- light immunoglobulin light chain-negative, CD43-low, and is BP-1-positive, CD45R-positive and CD25-positive. This cell type is also described as being AA4-positive, IgM-negative, CD19-positive, CD43-low/negative, and HSA-positive.\")\n14519:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0002052 \"Fraction D precursor B cells are also reportedly CD24-positive and sIgD-negative.\")\n14539:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:ak\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:dsd\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:17582343\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:18432934\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37442242\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002054 \"An immature B cell that is IgM-positive, CD45R-positive, CD43-low, CD25-negative, and CD127-negative. This cell type has also been described as being AA4-positive, IgM-positive, CD19-positive, CD43-low/negative, and HSA-positive.\")\n14542:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0002054 \"Markers associated with mouse cells. These cells are also reportedly sIgD-negative.\")\n14548:# Class: obo:CL_0002055 (CD38-negative immature B cell)\n14550:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:18432934\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002055 \"An immature B cell that is CD38-negative, CD10-low, CD21-low, and CD22-high.\")\n14554:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0002055 \"CD38-negative immature B cell\")\n14561:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:17582343\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37442242\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002056 \"A mature B cell subset originally defined as having being CD45R-positive, IgM-positive, IgD-positive and CD43-negative. Subsequent research demonstrated being CD21-positive and CD23-negative and CD93 negative.\")\n14569:# Class: obo:CL_0002057 (CD14-positive, CD16-negative classical monocyte)\n14571:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:15615263\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:1706877\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19689341\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:22343568\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002057 \"A classical monocyte that is CD14-positive, CD16-negative, CD64-positive, CD163-positive.\")\n14575:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0002057 \"CD16-negative monocyte\")\n14577:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0002057 \"CD14-positive, CD16-negative classical monocyte\")\n14586:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0002058 \"Markers are associated with mice. The Gr epitope is used to describe this cell type is found on both Ly6c and Ly6g. However, its the Ly6c that is considered the specific marker, and thus used in the cross-product. Also, this cell-type is sometimes described as being Gr1-negative.\")\n14961:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20200518\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002089 \"A group 2 innate lymphoid cell in the mouse capable of secreting IL-13 in response to a helminth infection. This cell is lineage-negative, ICOS-positive, IL1RL1-positive, IL7Ralpha-positive, and IL17Br-positive.\")\n15100:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:dsd\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:rhs\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20123131\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002101 \"A CD38-positive naive B cell is a mature B cell that has the phenotype CD38-positive, surface IgD-positive, surface IgM-positive, and CD27-negative, and that has not yet been activated by antigen in the periphery.\")\n15112:# Class: obo:CL_0002102 (CD38-negative naive B cell)\n15114:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:dsd\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:rhs\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20123131\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002102 \"A CD38-negative naive B cell is a mature B cell that has the phenotype CD38-negative, surface IgD-positive, surface IgM-positive, and CD27-negative, that has not yet been activated by antigen in the periphery.\")\n15119:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0002102 \"CD38-negative naive B lymphocyte\")\n15120:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0002102 \"CD38-negative naive B-cell\")\n15121:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0002102 \"CD38-negative naive B-lymphocyte\")\n15122:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0002102 \"CD38-negative naive B cell\")\n15126:# Class: obo:CL_0002103 (IgG-positive double negative memory B cell)\n15128:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:dsd\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:rhs\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20123131\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002103 \"An IgG-po