D38-positive IgG-negative memory B cell is a CD38-positive IgG-negative class switched memory B cell that lacks IgG on the cell surface with the phenotype B220-positive, CD38-positive, and IgG-negative.\")\n15332:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0002122 \"B220-positive CD38-positive IgG-negative class switched memory B cell\")\n15336:# Class: obo:CL_0002123 (B220-low CD38-positive IgG-negative class switched memory B cell)\n15338:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:dsd\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:rhs\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20123131\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002123 \"A B220-low CD38-positive IgG-negative memory B cell is a CD38-positive IgG-negative class switched memory B cell that lacks IgG on the cell surface with the phenotype B220-low, CD38-positive, and IgG-positive.\")\n15339:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0002123 \"B220-low CD38-positive IgG-negative class switched memory B cell\")\n15355:# Class: obo:CL_0002125 (CD27-negative gamma-delta T cell)\n15357:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:dsd\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19270712\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002125 \"A circulating gamma-delta T cell that expresses RORgamma(t), is CD27-negative and is capable of IL-17 secretion.\")\n15361:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0002125 \"CD27-negative gamma-delta T cell\")\n15386:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:dsd\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19201830\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:22343568\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002128 \"A CD8-positive, alpha-beta T cell that has the phenotype CXCR3-negative, CCR6-positive, CCR5-high, CD45RA-negative, and capable of producing IL-17 and some IFNg.\")\n15395:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0002128 \"This cell type is compatible with the HIPC Lyoplate markers for 'Tc17 CD8+ T cell', but its logical definition includes additional known characteristics of Tc17 T cells.  Found in the CD27-positive, CD28-positive or CD27-negative, CD28-positive fractions with the phenotype CCR4-negative and CCR7-negative (this sentence not part of definition).\")\n15519:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0002139 \"These cells are reportedly CD31-positive, CD34-positive, CD144-positive, TAL1-positive.\")\n16360:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"http://www.immgen.org\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002218 \"A double negative thymocyte that has a T cell receptor consisting of a gamma chain that has as part a Vgamma3 segment, and a delta chain. This cell type is CD4-negative, CD8-negative and CD24-positive. This cell-type is found in the fetal thymus with highest numbers occurring at E17-E18.\")\n17528:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0002322 \"This is an in vitro cell type and may be removed in future releases. These cells are reportedly SSEA-4-positive, CD73-negative, and CD324-positive.\")\n17699:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GO_REF:0000031\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:0781735149\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:12457618\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002338 \"A natural killer cell that is developmentally immature, has the phenotype CD34-negative, CD56-positive, CD117-positive, CD122-positive,and CD161-positive.\")\n17737:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19652886\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002342 \"A circulating endothelial cell of the phenotype CD146-positive, CD105-positive, CD45-negative. This cell type is indicative of recent vascular damage.\")\n17745:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:14568979\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19800965\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002343 \"A natural killer cell subset that is found in the decidual of the uterus and is CD56-high, Galectin-1-positive and CD16-negative. This cell type represents the most abundant immune cell type in the decidual during the first trimester of pregnancy.\")\n17755:# Class: obo:CL_0002344 (CD56-negative, CD161-positive immature natural killer cell, human)\n17757:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GO_REF:0000031\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:0781735149\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:12457618\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002344 \"A natural killer cell that is developmentally immature, has the phenotype CD34-negative, CD56-negative, CD117-positive, CD122-positive,and CD161-positive.\")\n17762:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0002344 \"CD56-negative, CD161-positive immature natural killer cell, human\")\n17776:# Class: obo:CL_0002346 (Dx5-negative, NK1.1-positive immature natural killer cell, mouse)\n17778:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:12766763\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002346 \"An immature natural killer cell that is NK1.1-positive and DX-5 negative.\")\n17781:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0002346 \"Dx5-negative, NK1.1-positive immature natural killer cell, mouse\")\n17844:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:978-1-60327-346-6\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:16569764\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002353 \"A hematopoietic stem cell that resides in the fetal liver. In mice, this cell type is first observed at E10.5. This cell type is MHC-positive, HSA-positive, AA4.1-positive, CD45-positive, Sca-1 positive, CD150-positive, CD48-negative and CD244-negative.\")\n17854:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1097/MOH.0b013e3282f97ae1\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002354 \"A hematopoietic stem found in the yolk sac. In mice, this cell type is Sca-1-negative, CD45-negative, MHC-negative, HSA-positive, AA4.1-positive, CD44-positive.\")\n18114:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"http://www.immgen.org\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002378 \"A double negative thymocyte that has a T cell receptor consisting of a gamma chain containing a Vgamma2 segment, and a delta chain. This cell type is CD4-negative, CD8-negative and CD24-positive and is found in the fetal thymus.\")\n18248:# Class: obo:CL_0002394 (CD141-positive myeloid dendritic cell)\n18250:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:dsd\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMCID:PMC2882828\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMCID:PMC2882837\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:17332250\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20628149\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002394 \"A myeloid dendritic cell found in the blood, lymph nodes, tonsil, bone marrow, and spleen that is CD141-positive (BDCA-3), XCR1-positive, and Clec9A-positive. This cell-type can cross-present antigen to CD8-positive T cells and can produce inteferon-beta.\")\n18254:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0002394 \"CD141-positive myeloid dendritic cell\")\n18260:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20628149\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:27098205\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:8890901\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"http://www.immgen.org/index_content.html\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002395 \"A resident monocyte that is Gr-1 high, CD43-negative, CX3CR1-negative, CD115-positive, and B220-negative.\")\n18268:# Class: obo:CL_0002396 (CD14-low, CD16-positive monocyte)\n18270:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20870168\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002396 \"A patrolling monocyte that is 